IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CCRDST.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-FROM PIC X(12).
01 WS-ACT PIC X(12).

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LS-FROM PIC X(12).
01 LS-ACT PIC X(12).
01 LS-TO PIC X(12).
01 LS-RC PIC X(02).
01 LS-MSG PIC X(80).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LS-FROM LS-ACT LS-TO LS-RC LS-MSG.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-FROM WS-ACT
    MOVE LS-FROM TO WS-FROM
    MOVE LS-ACT TO WS-ACT
    MOVE "00" TO LS-RC
    MOVE SPACES TO LS-MSG
    MOVE LS-FROM TO LS-TO
    EVALUATE WS-FROM
        WHEN "REQUESTED" PERFORM FROM-REQUESTED
        WHEN "APPROVED" PERFORM FROM-APPROVED
        WHEN "ISSUED" PERFORM FROM-ISSUED
        WHEN "ACTIVE" PERFORM FROM-ACTIVE
        WHEN "BLOCKED" PERFORM FROM-BLOCKED
        WHEN "SUSPENDED" PERFORM FROM-SUSPENDED
        WHEN "EXPIRED" PERFORM FROM-EXPIRED
        WHEN "REPLACED" PERFORM FROM-REPLACED
        WHEN "CANCELLED" PERFORM FROM-TERMINAL
        WHEN "CLOSED" PERFORM FROM-TERMINAL
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "99" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE
    IF LS-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE "INVALID CARD TRANSITION" TO LS-MSG
    END-IF
    GOBACK.

FROM-REQUESTED.
    EVALUATE WS-ACT
        WHEN "APPROVE" MOVE "APPROVED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "REJECT" MOVE "CANCELLED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CANCEL" MOVE "CANCELLED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "20" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE.

FROM-APPROVED.
    EVALUATE WS-ACT
        WHEN "ISSUE" MOVE "ISSUED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CANCEL" MOVE "CANCELLED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "20" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE.

FROM-ISSUED.
    EVALUATE WS-ACT
        WHEN "ACTIVATE" MOVE "ACTIVE" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "EXPIRE" MOVE "EXPIRED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CANCEL" MOVE "CANCELLED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "REPLACE" MOVE "REPLACED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "BLOCK" MOVE "BLOCKED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "SUSPEND" MOVE "SUSPENDED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "20" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE.

FROM-ACTIVE.
    EVALUATE WS-ACT
        WHEN "BLOCK" MOVE "BLOCKED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "SUSPEND" MOVE "SUSPENDED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "EXPIRE" MOVE "EXPIRED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CANCEL" MOVE "CANCELLED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "REPLACE" MOVE "REPLACED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CLOSE" MOVE "CLOSED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "20" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE.

FROM-BLOCKED.
    EVALUATE WS-ACT
        WHEN "UNBLOCK" MOVE "ACTIVE" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "SUSPEND" MOVE "SUSPENDED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "EXPIRE" MOVE "EXPIRED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CANCEL" MOVE "CANCELLED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "REPLACE" MOVE "REPLACED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CLOSE" MOVE "CLOSED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "20" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE.

FROM-SUSPENDED.
    EVALUATE WS-ACT
        WHEN "RESUME" MOVE "ACTIVE" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "BLOCK" MOVE "BLOCKED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "EXPIRE" MOVE "EXPIRED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CANCEL" MOVE "CANCELLED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "REPLACE" MOVE "REPLACED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CLOSE" MOVE "CLOSED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "20" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE.

FROM-EXPIRED.
    EVALUATE WS-ACT
        WHEN "REPLACE" MOVE "REPLACED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CLOSE" MOVE "CLOSED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CANCEL" MOVE "CANCELLED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "20" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE.

FROM-REPLACED.
    EVALUATE WS-ACT
        WHEN "CLOSE" MOVE "CLOSED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN "CANCEL" MOVE "CANCELLED" TO LS-TO
        WHEN OTHER MOVE "20" TO LS-RC
    END-EVALUATE.

FROM-TERMINAL.
    MOVE "20" TO LS-RC.
